# Built artifacts: the ICD/shim DSOs and the packaged zip (built by build_hybris.sh + dist/package.sh)
dist/*
!dist/meta.json
!dist/package.sh
# build_id.json is the record of what the last build produced and shipped - the file that makes a
# session's artifact traceable. Keep it: it is the one thing that must NOT be a generated-and-forgotten
# leftover, or "what did we actually run?" is unanswerable again.
!dist/build_id.json
icd/libvulkan_powervr.so
build/
